      "statusChangeID": "66ce06e375eb5af72e585d40",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Sorry about this, but your avatar contains too many constraints.\n\nWe enforce a maximum upper limit of 2000 constraints per avatar for performance reasons, which we feel is fairly generous compared to the limit of 15 constraints per avatar that was previously recommended before the introduction of VRChat constraints. Since this avatar contains more than 2000 constraints, the excess constraints are removed as your avatar is loaded in-game, which results in the behavior you've reported.\n\nThis avatar would need to be optimized to reduce the number of constraints on it. Given how this cloning system appears to work, that might mean reducing the number of bones on the avatar, or setting small or irrelevant bones to be ignored by the cloning system if it supports this.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
