      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{642a7970ed79c9c93ec4d9ed|full_name}\n\nThe specific issues reported by you and others in related Canny posts were addressed as far as we're aware. If you know of Canny posts on this topic that were marked as Available in Future Release where the specific problem described in that Canny still isn't addressed, please feel free to list them here and we'll investigate them.\n\nPlease note that we enforce an upper limit of 2000 constraints per avatar as described above. While that limit does trigger the same symptoms for the avatar in this report as in your own previous report regarding your clone system, the underlying cause is not the same.",
